🚀 Local Setup & Configuration
1. Prerequisites
JDK 17 or higher

Maven 3.8+

MySQL 8.0+

2. Configuration
Configure your src/main/resources/application.properties with database and API keys:

Properties
spring.datasource.url=jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/ecommerce_db?createDatabaseIfNotExist=true
spring.datasource.username=root
spring.datasource.password=yourpassword
spring.jpa.hibernate.ddl-auto=update

# JWT Configuration
app.jwt.secret=your_jwt_256_bit_secret_key_here
app.jwt.expiration-ms=86400000

# Gemini AI Key
gemini.api.key=YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY
3. Run Locally
Bash
# Clone the repository
git clone [https://github.com/gokulkrishna12/E-Commerce-BACKEND.git](https://github.com/gokulkrishna12/E-Commerce-BACKEND.git)
cd E-Commerce-BACKEND

# Package and run
mvn clean spring-boot:run
🔄 CI/CD & Cloud Infrastructure
The backend uses a fully automated deployment pipeline via .github/workflows/deploy.yml:

Pushes to main trigger a GitHub Actions runner.

Compiles and packages the application using mvn clean package -DskipTests.

Deploys the generated ecommerce-backend-0.0.1-SNAPSHOT.jar to AWS EC2 over SSH/SCP.

Restarts the background service (sudo systemctl restart shopease) with zero manual terminal interaction.

